@host = http://localhost:5007

### Hesap aç → 201 { id }  (AccountOpened)
# @name open
POST {{host}}/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "owner": "Ali" }

### Para yatır (MoneyDeposited)
POST {{host}}/accounts/{{open.response.body.$.id}}/deposit
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 200 }

### Para çek (MoneyWithdrawn)
POST {{host}}/accounts/{{open.response.body.$.id}}/withdraw
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 100 }

### Yetersiz bakiye → 409
POST {{host}}/accounts/{{open.response.body.$.id}}/withdraw
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 100000 }

### Optimistic concurrency: eski versiyonla yazma → 409 Concurrency
POST {{host}}/accounts/{{open.response.body.$.id}}/deposit
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 5, "expectedVersion": 1 }

### Güncel durum (event'lerden rehydrate; 5+ event varsa snapshot'tan)
GET {{host}}/accounts/{{open.response.body.$.id}}

### Ham event akışı (audit) — timestamp'leri buradan alın
GET {{host}}/accounts/{{open.response.body.$.id}}/events

### Temporal query: verilen andaki bakiye (timestamp'i /events çıktısından kopyalayın)
GET {{host}}/accounts/{{open.response.body.$.id}}/balance-at?timestamp=2026-01-01T00:00:00Z

### Projeksiyondan hesap listesi (AccountBalances)
GET {{host}}/accounts

### Projeksiyonu sil ve tüm event'leri baştan oynat
POST {{host}}/admin/projections/rebuild

### Hesabı kapat (AccountClosed) → 204
POST {{host}}/accounts/{{open.response.body.$.id}}/close

### Kapalı hesaba işlem → 409
POST {{host}}/accounts/{{open.response.body.$.id}}/deposit
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 10 }
